Folia standalone nTv channel plugin, version 1.

MatchScore.java is a simplified Java adaptation of the title/artist scoring,
confidence cap and duration multipliers in chthollyphile/folia-major:
https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-major/blob/main/src/utils/lyrics/matchScore.ts
Copyright the Folia contributors. Licensed under AGPL-3.0.
The adaptation omits album matching, kana/Chinese normalization and artist token scoring.

This plugin's compact HTML renderer is newly implemented for nTv. It is not the
complete Folia React application and does not include Folia's original animation
themes, Folium modules, account system or desktop features.

Plugin source: plugins/folia in https://github.com/buhanzhe/NativeWasmTv
